# The extension host is bundled into dist/ by `npm run bundle`, so neither the
# TypeScript output it was compiled from nor the dependency tree it was built
# with belongs in the package: 235 files, 186 of them JavaScript, every one of
# them a file the editor host would otherwise parse per window.
